<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5647" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφ-ᾰδόν</span></b> , Adv., poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναφαδόν</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναφανδόν</span>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφανδόν</span>), <i>publicly, openly,
				without disguise,</i> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάθρη, βαλέειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.243
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρυφηδόν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.330
			</span></i>; opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόλῳ, κτείνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.296
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πάντ᾽ ἀγορεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.370
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἀ πέπραγα πανταχῇ
			καλῶς</span> Ion Trag. ap. Phot.<i><span class="en">
				p.98
			</span></i> R.—Prop. neut. of Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφαδός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, which
			occurs in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.391
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ἀμφαδὰ ἔργα γένοιτο</span>
			<i>discovered, known,</i> cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.615
			</span></i>.</div>
